OL,3,GNEWSACommunity skips proposed to fight
OL,4,Afly-tipping
OL,5,
OL,6,FCity chiefs are to vote on installing
OL,7,Fcommunity skips in an effort to tackle
OL,8,Ffly-tipping and help clear a waste
OL,9,Fbacklog.
OL,11,FThe trial scheme being put before
OL,12,FSunderland councillors would see skips
OL,13,Fplaced in Deptford and Hendon, Pallion
OL,14,Fand Ford and Washington Central wards,
OL,15,Fwith a hope to expand it across all
OL,16,Fareas of the city if successful.
OL,18,FThe plan has been proposed by Liberal
OL,19,FDemocrat councillors who form the main
OL,20,Fopposition on the Reform UK-led
OL,21,Fauthority.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
