OL,3,GNEWSACommunity skips proposed to fight
OL,4,Afly-tipping
OL,5,
OL,6,FWednesday's council meeting is also set
OL,7,Fto discuss measures for "maintaining
OL,8,Fand improving access to free bulky
OL,9,Fwaste collections". Currently a
OL,10,Fcollection of up to six items is free
OL,11,Fto residents.
